  "text": "Store Locator\nVisit us at our convenient location in the heart of New York City. Our store offers a wide selection of precious metals and expert advice. We look forward to assisting you with your bullion needs.\nNeed Hands On Experience? We’ve Our Store Open for You\nDays\nMonday – Thursday\nFriday\nTime\n8:30 AM – 4 PM\n8:30AM –1 PM\n20 W 47th St, New York, NY 10036, United States\n+1 646-362-3536\n[email protected]\nGo to Map",
